=== TIME (time_grain, date_from, date_to) ===
- "this year" = Jan 1 of TODAY's year to TODAY. "last year" = the full previous calendar year.
- "last N months" = the 1st of the month N months before TODAY's month, to TODAY.
- Seasons: spring Mar 1–May 31, summer Jun 1–Aug 31, fall Sep 1–Nov 30, winter Dec 1–Feb 28/29. "last <season>" = the most recent one that has fully ended.
- "since 2020" = date_from 2020-01-01, date_to null. No dates mentioned = both null (all history).
- Grain: use what the user says. Otherwise: a multi-year range → year; a range of 1 year or less → month; a single total with no time trend → none.

